        "| Freshness timestamp semantics | Interval boundaries are separate from provider/fetch freshness; future point timestamps are invalid | migration 0035, market-freshness.ts, boundary tests |",
        "| Latest stream starvation | Latest-per-complete-stream is selected before any global limit | 321-revision multi-asset regression fixture |",
        "| Point-in-time availability | Every required candidate and benchmark input must be available at decision time | ten-day late-revision regression and phase2a-research.ts |",
        "| Point/bootstrap population mismatch | Point estimates and intervals now share the same complete scheduled-date block population | uncertainty metadata and corrected v2 report |",
        "| Positive/negative controls | Direct controls use the shared evaluator; an additional known positive traverses the actual feature/entry/label path; fixed negative seeds are diagnostics, not a precise false-positive rate | machine/synthetic-* and machine/pipeline-positive-control-report.json |",
